WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.595
Today the missing letter is at the end of the word.

2
00:00:03.045 --> 00:00:05.624
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:06.124 --> 00:00:10.369
The end of a word is harder to hear than the start. So say the word slowly.

4
00:00:10.819 --> 00:00:15.272
Say the name of the first picture. Tub. Ask: what is the last sound?

5
00:00:16.506 --> 00:00:17.859
Bat first, then ball.

6
00:00:20.888 --> 00:00:21.916
The word is tub.

7
00:00:22.816 --> 00:00:25.033
Here is one with the other letter. Lid.

8
00:00:26.361 --> 00:00:28.646
The round part first, then up and down.

9
00:00:32.221 --> 00:00:33.243
The word is lid.

10
00:00:34.143 --> 00:00:37.863
Do two pictures together. Then your child carries on with the page.

11
00:00:38.313 --> 00:00:41.986
For job two, press play on your child's sound track and step away.

12
00:00:42.436 --> 00:00:44.948
At the end, your child reads three words to you.
